> > > > > >   COG_z ~ b*BAG_z + c*CR_z + gender_beh + age_cen_within
> > > > > >
> > > > > >   indirect := a*b
> > > > > >   total    := c + (a*b)
> > > > > > "
> > > > > > H3: independent effects: Model3 <- "
